d ventilation.</span></p></li><li data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"689\"><p data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"689\"><strong data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"609\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Work Pod</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">A mini office pod equipped with integrated seating and optional built-in screens, ideal for focused work.</span></p></li><li data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"816\"><p data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"816\"><strong data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"736\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Pod Two</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">A meeting pod accommodating two people, featuring comfortable seating and advanced acoustic design.</span></p></li><li data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"943\"><p data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"943\"><strong data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"863\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Pod Four</span></strong>: <span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">A spacious meeting booth for up to four individuals, combining functionality with exceptional sound isolation.</span></p></li></ul><p data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"943\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\">Each pod is crafted with high-quality materials, including recycled PET felt for sound absorption, and features integrated wheels for easy mobility.</span></p><p data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"943\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\"><strong>